{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdALHV7JyFv5hbuNBdHba","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014yHmP2bN19v2cWKwgxHbgk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"C:/Projects/ai-template-trains/1-g3-WI-227-cec3\" && cat > /tmp/wi227_msg.txt <<'EOF'\nWI-227: caret-escape trailing data args so cmd.exe can't re-expose a separator\n\nRework for the review of abff35b (CHANGES-REQUESTED, 1 MAJOR): _win_quote\nMSVCRT-quoted each Windows data arg but left the double quotes cmd.exe would\nact on, so a value combining a literal `\"` with `&`/`|` (e.g. `a\"&b`) ended\ncmd.exe's quoted region early and re-exposed the separator to the shell —\nviolating WI-227's ruled data contract for that whole input class.\n\nFix: after MSVCRT quoting, a phase-2 caret-escapes every cmd.exe metacharacter\nin the result — the separators/redirects `& | < > ( ) ^` AND the `\"` chars\nphase 1 added. cmd.exe then treats each `\"` as a non-toggling literal, never\nenters a quoted region, and passes the token through whole; the program's own\nargv parser recovers it. Proven on this box: `a\"&b`, `a\"|b`, `a\"&b|c`, `a b\"&c`\nnow reach the program as one literal token (each failed pre-fix). Also fixed a\nbug in the first draft of the phase-2 pass — it iterated the quoting list's\nmulti-char elements instead of characters, so an inner `\\\"` escaped nothing;\njoin first, then escape per character.\n\nLimit (b) (quote-plus-separator) is thereby eliminated, not documented; only\n`%VAR%`/`!VAR!` env expansion remains a residual limit (cmd.exe expands it\nbefore caret processing). Spec ruling + module docstring updated to match.\n\nTests: three cross-platform regressions combining `\"` with `&`, `|`, and both\nat once added to the data-arg parametrization (Windows exercises the caret fix;\nshlex.quote already covered POSIX). run_menu suite 20p/1s; full suite 1084p/4s;\nruff format+lint clean.\n\nWI: WI-227\nTrain: 1-g3-WI-227-cec3\nBase: 808f95da957c1ce90476e8807acb784159255107\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit add project-trajectory/scripts/run_menu.py tests/test_run_menu.py docs/specs/WI-227.md && git commit -F /tmp/wi227_msg.txt 2>&1 | tail -6","description":"Stage the three files and commit the rework"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1092,"cache_read_input_tokens":92196,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1092},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8129915d-af74-417e-9484-18e89a7f2f16","uuid":"6567acb1-37cf-41b4-ac49-e664efdef2a7","request_id":"req_011CdALHTu8QcWx1r2MvezFF"}
